# Flappy's level (DENG-648): the DENG-215 scene format, one [[entity]] per entity.
# Side view in world X-Z (Z up), 32 pixels per metre; the camera looks along +Y.
# The game moves the bird, pipes and clouds while it runs; this is where they start.

